		ees2:6 f4:9 bes:9.5+ | ees2:6 e:dim7 | f:m7 bes:9.11 | ees:maj7 (bes:13) |
		ees:6 a4:m7.5- d:7.9- | g:sus4 gis:dim7 | a:m7 d4:9sus4 (d:9) | g:7 c:7 f:7 bes:7 | bes:7 |
		(the durations of the last bars are incomplete). It also listed
		youtube ids ViniUjqqVZI (Hank Mobley, no longer available) and
		XASZpJcgVLI (Nat King Cole).
